  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_c4372955-c8ad-4b7f-b5a6-7696cca9bfad.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"262\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/commits-since/Gilded-Games/The-Aether/1.14.4-0.0.1?color=22272E&amp;label=commits&amp;logo=github&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&amp;label=issues&amp;logo=github&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-pr-raw/Gilded-Games/The-Aether?color=22272E&amp;label=pull requests&amp;logo=github&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&amp;type=pledges&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=7289DA&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/crowdin-aether-blue?color=55BC5C&amp;label=crowdin&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"115\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 关于以太世界 ☁️<br></strong></span></h2><p>以太团队为您呈现原版以太模组！持续维护更新至最新Minecraft版本，并完美支持多人游戏！</p><p>以太世界是一个高悬于云端的维度，由<strong>广阔的天域</strong>和<strong>浮空岛</strong>组成。这个维度拥有全新的生存冒险体验，基于类似原版的<strong>生存进阶体系</strong>，包含<strong>新矿石</strong>、<strong>神话生物</strong>和<strong>三座危险地牢</strong>，每座地牢都有独特的<strong>强力战利品</strong>。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image0.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 模组内容 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>以太模组包含众多全新功能，大部分内容在<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1275355-1-7-3-aether-collaboration-mod-v1-02-new-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">以太合作模组</a>的原帖中有详细介绍。简要概述如下：</p><ul>\n<li>天空中的危险乐园：以太维度！注意不要掉下去，否则你会回到主世界。</li>\n<li>来自维度本身的全新方块和物品。</li>\n<li>3种实用方块：祭坛、冷冻器和孵化器。</li>\n<li>4种材料等级：天根木、圣石、蓝宝石和重力晶，每种都有独特能力的工具和武器。</li>\n<li>知识之书，包含模组中每个方块和物品的条目。</li>\n<li>独特的饰品系统GUI，让你能使用发现的战利品。</li>\n<li>既有主世界熟悉的生物，也有以太独有的生物。</li>\n<li>飞鸟：一种可骑乘的飞行生物，不同等级有不同的跳跃次数。</li>\n<li>3座新地牢：青铜地牢、白银地牢和黄金地牢，各有专属装备和Boss。</li>\n<li>永恒白昼：只有征服最终地牢后才能结束，此后可通过独特实用方块“太阳祭坛”控制昼夜循环。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252faether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/255308/description_b9ff2a53-d0c1-4bb9-b5a1-fe05b6e238ec.png\"></a></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"> </pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 开始探险 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>要进入以太世界，你需要用<strong>荧石</strong>搭建一个传送门框架，然后在中间用<strong>水桶</strong>激活。这将开启传送门，让你踏入这个维度，开始以太危险乐园的生存之旅！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"387\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 征服地牢 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>以太世界中隐藏着三座神秘地牢，每座都有凶猛的Boss等待你挑战……</p><p><strong>青铜地牢</strong>是哨卫的巢穴，由可怕的<strong>滑行者</strong>守护，这个生物由纯粹的石头构成。留意隐藏在岛屿中的隧道，用你能打造的最强装备武装自己！</p><p><strong>白银地牢</strong>是美丽的瓦尔基里神庙。挑战瓦尔基里骑士团的骑士们，如果你证明了自己的实力，就能与<strong>瓦尔基里女王</strong>本人交战。利用一切工具和技巧来战胜这位古老的战士。</p><p>在稀有的<strong>黄金地牢</strong>中沉睡着<strong>太阳之灵</strong>，这个由纯粹火焰与能量构成的永恒存在统治着太阳本身，需要费一番功夫才能让它注意到你这样的凡物。但传闻它的守护着以太最珍贵的宝藏。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/blob/main/images/image2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"356\"></p><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 敬请期待 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faetherlegends.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/refs/heads/main/images/legends.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"7680\" height=\"2160\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 加入讨论 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>加入我们的Discord服务器，与超过10,000名成员的社区交流！</p><p>有关于模组的问题？需要安装帮助？发现Bug？我们为以太模组设立了专门的支援和开发频道！或者你只是想聊聊天，在我们的官方服务器组织游戏活动？以太Discord就是最好的去处！我们友好的工作人员和热情的社区会让你宾至如归！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 支持以太团队 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>没有你们的支持，以太模组就不可能存在。请考虑赞助帮助开发！每一笔赞助都会直接用于开发，让我们能够继续做我们最热爱的事。<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 参与项目 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>想要为以太模组做出贡献？以太是开源项目，这意味着任何感兴趣的人都可以贡献代码来帮助项目发展！更多信息请访问我们的<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#wrench-contribute-to-the-project\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub仓库</a>。</p><p>我们也通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftranslate.aether.devaether.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>接受项目翻译，让更多玩家能够了解以太模组！</p><p>我们的<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/README.md#speech_balloon-translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">翻译</a>和代码<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/The-Aether/blob/1.19.4-develop/docs/CREDITS.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献</a>致谢名单可在GitHub仓库中找到。</p>",
